    "1. 确认电脑上的 DSH 开着、插件已加载；\n2. 手机设置里允许本 App 使用「本地网络」；\n3. 关掉手机上的代理/VPN 再连一次（它会接管 UDP，打洞会失败）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. Make sure DSH is running on your computer and the plugin is loaded;\n2. Allow Local Network access for this app in iOS Settings;\n3. Turn off any proxy/VPN on the phone and try again (it takes over UDP, so hole-punching fails)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "6 位配对码": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "6-digit pairing code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 内的本地代理只监听 127.0.0.1，但手机上其它 App 可以连上它，而且端口可以由主机 ID 推算出来。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The in-app local proxy listens on 127.0.0.1 only, but other apps on this phone can connect to it, and the port is derivable from the host ID."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 内的本地代理只监听 127.0.0.1，但手机上其它 App 可以连上它，而且端口能由主机 ID 推算出来。一期如实告知，后续会加进程内握手令牌。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The in-app local proxy listens on 127.0.0.1 only, but other apps on this phone can connect to it, and the port is derivable from the host ID. We tell you now; an in-process handshake token comes later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
