    "「标识」是别的配置引用这个提供商用的键，建好之后不能改。\n\n「密钥名」是电脑端凭据库里的**名字**，密钥原文在下面单独填。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“ID” is the key other settings use to reference this provider — it can’t change after creation.\n\n“Key name” is the **name** in your computer’s credential store; enter the actual key separately below."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一期如实告知；后续可加一个进程内的随机握手令牌（需要电脑端配合）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We say so up front; a random in-process handshake token can be added later (it needs the computer side to cooperate)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一次尝试未产出内容": {
