    "会话内容会缓存在本机，切回之前的会话时不用再等一次远程加载。缓存放在系统可回收的位置，随时可以清空 —— 清空只影响速度，不会丢任何东西。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sessions are cached on this device, so switching back doesn’t wait for a remote reload. The cache lives in a system-reclaimable location and you can clear it anytime — clearing only costs speed, nothing is lost."
          }
        }
