    "密钥**只写不读**：走的是已经端到端加密的 iroh 通道，存在电脑端的凭据库里；之后手机只能查到「配过没有」，拉不回原文。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keys are **write-only**: they travel over the already end-to-end-encrypted iroh channel and live in your computer’s credential store. Your phone can only see whether one is configured — never the value."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密钥不在手机上：提供商配的是**环境变量名**，真正的 key 在电脑的环境里。左滑可以删除。": {
