    "左滑删除。新建要在会话里发 `/schedule` —— 服务端的写接口要求传完整记录和乐观并发版本，比命令脆弱得多。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swipe to delete. Create reminders with `/schedule` in a session — the write API needs a full record plus an optimistic-concurrency version, which is far more fragile than the command."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "左滑删除。模型里没在界面上列出的字段（推理档位、模板参数…）会**原样保留**。\n\n模型 id 要和电脑端认的完全一致，否则这个提供商会保存失败。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swipe to delete. Fields not shown here (reasoning levels, template args…) are **preserved as-is**.\n\nThe model id must match exactly what your computer expects, or the provider will be rejected."
          }
        }
      }
